{
  "_createdAt": "2026-03-31T14:59:33Z",
  "_id": "post-granola-pricing-startups-free-trial-discounts",
  "_rev": "WML3b1jxzn1AOFDHasM0BA",
  "_system": {
    "base": {
      "id": "post-granola-pricing-startups-free-trial-discounts",
      "rev": "1M5G74w851CzvOgp7GpYAj"
    }
  },
  "_type": "post",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-06-28T12:31:52Z",
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "1fc695190bd1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "11aa264b9bfc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "TL;DR"
        },
        {
          "_key": "79880e7f5bc3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n- Granola offers a 1-year free Business plan for startups with fewer than 30 employees that have raised a pre-seed or seed round.\n- The Basic plan is free with no meeting limits and functions as your built-in free trial, giving you unlimited meetings to evaluate the product with no time cap.\n- Basic plan constraints include limited meeting history (last 30 days), no advanced AI thinking models, and limited integrations compared to Business tier.\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4a30be39c21f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "71376adac5ce",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Early-stage teams face a documentation gap that gets expensive fast. You need an accurate record of what investors flagged in Tuesday's pitch call, what the enterprise prospect raised as a blocker last week, and what your head of engineering committed to in Thursday's roadmap session. Every new software seat reduces runway, and every visible recording participant in a sensitive conversation creates friction you cannot afford."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "cb4e76b84751",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6f345cfa912d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We built Granola's pricing around that tension. The free Basic plan has no meeting limits, and eligible startups get the full Business plan free for one year."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0ba017a7ceec",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a1c510d4716c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola pricing for early-stage teams"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8a4bc3ad96f6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "48836f4a2652",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola offers three tiers: Basic, Business, and Enterprise. We've broken down what each plan includes below, with the startup offer highlighted."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "html0",
      "_type": "rawHtml",
      "html": "<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 25%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 25%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 25%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 25%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Feature</th>\n<th>Basic (free)</th>\n<th>Business ($14/user/mo)</th>\n<th>Enterprise ($35+/user/mo)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>AI-enhanced meeting notes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meetings per month</td>\n<td>Unlimited</td>\n<td>Unlimited</td>\n<td>Unlimited</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meeting notes and history</td>\n<td>Last 30 days</td>\n<td>Full history</td>\n<td>Full history</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MCP (AI tool integration)</td>\n<td>Last 30 days, no transcripts</td>\n<td>Full history + transcripts</td>\n<td>Full history + transcripts (admin-enabled)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shared team folders</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Advanced AI models + integrations</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSO and org-wide admin controls</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API data access for internal tooling</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI training opt-out</td>\n<td>All users</td>\n<td>All users</td>\n<td>All users (org-wide)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>1-year free startup offer</strong></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td><strong>Eligible startups</strong></td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f8eb646b974e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c745bfb4e32e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Some third-party review and coupon sites carry outdated information, listing legacy plans that Granola no longer offers, including an \"Individual\" tier or a free cap tied to a set number of meetings. The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "d6dfa9cd79dd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "4d5c4c40f92b"
          ],
          "text": "official pricing page"
        },
        {
          "_key": "def8c5bf0d5e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is the only reliable source for current plan details, and it shows three tiers: Basic (free, unlimited meetings), Business ($14/user/month), and Enterprise ($35+/user/month). Verify there before acting on anything from a comparison site."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "4d5c4c40f92b",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/pricing"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ce5a0ae2b514",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "90d168c9a8c1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Basic plan"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fd7ccf494c16",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7b2e5e3b0d5e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Basic plan is free and has no meeting limits. You get AI-enhanced notes, AI chat within and across meetings, shared folders, customizable note templates (desktop only), and multi-language support. Setup takes under five minutes from download to first "
        },
        {
          "_key": "97b7edd228d4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "489192240732"
          ],
          "text": "transcribed meeting"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0c2f0d743019",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "489192240732",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/ai-meeting-assistant"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3fad1c288664",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f70ab9ab01e4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "On the Basic plan, note history is limited, and notes older than 30 days are stored but not visible in the app. If you're downgrading from Business to Basic:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "721757be85ec",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "650678dac1e3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Go to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "1dcca0912932",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Settings > Profile > Generate CSV"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00641918f4d3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "df383b74f867",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Export includes titles and summaries (full transcripts are not included)"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4315ca38c9ad",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "be0128f1af98",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The CSV arrives by email within a few hours"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b8aec7cb5750",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "eb6fdc9eb606",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Easy to set up and runs quietly in the background. Accurate discussion summaries with the backup transcript available.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "7ec6d2fcc2fe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "6b4d92cc4ef9"
          ],
          "text": "Joe M. on G2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "16e463e75cbc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "6b4d92cc4ef9",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-11055567"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4cb03b3fc3ed",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "29ede6fcf942",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Business plan"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "869bde049e4d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7b97fc9e3ee9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Business plan costs $14 per user per month, billed monthly. When team members join or leave, Stripe automatically prorates your bill. You get full note history, full transcript access, advanced AI thinking models, and all integrations including Notion, Slack, HubSpot, Attio, Affinity, and Zapier. MCP access extends to your complete meeting history with transcript retrieval enabled."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ca3f0ebf5299",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d353c9991628",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When you cancel, your subscription continues until the end of the current billing period, after which you revert to the Basic plan with 30-day history access in the app. Full details are on the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "8fd56a4601f0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "2cb5f69873b1"
          ],
          "text": "subscriptions and billing page"
        },
        {
          "_key": "186b95daebbf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "2cb5f69873b1",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/subscriptions-and-billing"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8f9fa4777c0b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6b8f246c7f7b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Enterprise plan"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "46bd80c55f3e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d850dd84fd6e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We price Enterprise at $35 per user per month and up, adding SSO, priority support, usage analytics, org-wide auto-deletion controls, and API data access for internal tooling. Enterprise also includes an org-wide AI training opt-out and a pilot feature for org-wide notification that Granola is in use."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "71a3d58ba545",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c7dae844328a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola holds "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f2df720a2f28",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "de29c3be151f"
          ],
          "text": "SOC 2 Type 2 certification"
        },
        {
          "_key": "20cc590a4dd6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " (achieved July 2025) and maintains GDPR compliance, with a Data Processing Agreement available on request. Note that Granola is "
        },
        {
          "_key": "9d4e441bfa26",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "89fed025659c"
          ],
          "text": "not currently HIPAA compliant"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2e4b66395866",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "de29c3be151f",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/updates/granola-is-soc2-type-2-compliant"
        },
        {
          "_key": "89fed025659c",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/consent-security-privacy/is-granola-hipaa-compliant"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fba7c1d7f3e2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "38c1f07cd0f5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Granola for Startups program"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "be8c95d5102a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d9cfc01e7ac4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What the 1-year free Business plan includes"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3e03ca1cd880",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "af560fa08df1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We give eligible startup teams 12 months of the full Business plan at no cost through our "
        },
        {
          "_key": "e4c1096f9202",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "edaaf1e024db"
          ],
          "text": "startup program"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2a3bc1653484",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". That means unlimited note history, full transcript access, advanced AI thinking models, all integrations, shared team folders, centralized billing, and full MCP access across your meeting history."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "edaaf1e024db",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/startups"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4ce79e37600a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2a239bd6da22",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For a 10-person founding team, this amounts to $1,680 in annual software cost. More practically, it gives your team a shared record of every customer call, investor conversation, and product decision before you have the headcount to maintain that context manually."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "248043c0268e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ec3c094f3556",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Overall, the value of Granola far exceeds its price.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "c1a4578ab27c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "71953799e346"
          ],
          "text": "Cory M. on G2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "76d81632afbb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "71953799e346",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-10923322"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5982564cad8b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7f87bbf60338",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Avoid third-party coupon sites when looking for deals. The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "5b232a111756",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "860958a7a55c"
          ],
          "text": "official startup page"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5c3e801bac67",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " always has our current offer."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "860958a7a55c",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://granola.ai/startups"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8f3bad43e694",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4a42422939a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Eligibility and how to apply"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7a60ff163605",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c0784796d8fb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The startup program is open to teams that meet both criteria:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d92e499fe6cc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d9376d6dd106",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Check eligibility:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "49f72cfa6e38",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Fewer than 30 employees, a completed pre-seed or seed round, and no prior Granola paid subscription or promotional code use."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "086ccdb71986",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "94edd59d8a1c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Apply:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e48e5404521e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Visit the official startup page and submit your details directly."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f6e5b0d38eee",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00bcd9373146",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Get confirmed:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5d7bb40b3ea9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " You'll receive confirmation after submitting."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f7793c075ce3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d7206dce9c0f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If your team is past the seed stage or over 30 people, the Business plan at $14 per user per month is the right entry point."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e25df58bb32f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "328a1ac4a590",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How to optimize your Granola spend"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d8783d19d758",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "01185a0b4bbd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Getting the most from Granola's pricing comes down to three decisions: who gets a paid seat, when you upgrade, and when you apply for the startup program."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2d28795992af",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "592ab7b8ebf4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Not every person on a team needs a Business seat. Individual contributors who only need notes from their own meetings can stay on Basic indefinitely at no cost. Reserve Business seats for users who need CRM integrations, full note history, or the ability to query shared team folders. Right-sizing this way keeps your per-seat spend proportional to actual usage rather than rolling everyone onto the same plan by default."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "53130d64f775",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "450494f17d31",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Basic has no time cap, which makes it a genuine evaluation period rather than a trial. There is no pressure to upgrade before your team has confirmed which integrations they actually need. Run Basic through a full quarter of real meetings, identify which workflows stall without Business features, then move specific users rather than the whole team. Upgrading before you have that clarity tends to result in paying for capabilities nobody uses."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1a8ccf427eab",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "047adc44f151",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "On startup program timing: apply before purchasing any seats. The eligibility criteria explicitly exclude teams with a prior paid subscription or promotional code use. If your team buys Business seats first and discovers the program later, you are disqualified. Check eligibility at the start of your evaluation, not after you have already committed budget."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "308bb2ddd5b2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c4b549aec644",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why founders choose Granola over bot-based tools"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a94ff8637155",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "02da86fbdb0a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Beyond transparent pricing, Granola solves two practical problems that affect how founders spend time and money: confidential meeting capture and knowledge retention."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e108e17a5c3c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "25acd8125a09",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Bot-free capture for confidential conversations"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bf9e564cf5ed",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "899363e5a18a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola captures meetings through device audio rather than joining as a participant:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "432451a9b6ff",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ba6f7b2cc81c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Uses your system audio and microphone directly on your computer"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "751099d4b698",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b310e477c92e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No bot appears in the participant list"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0f726e332b5d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "15dea8eb2065",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No \"recording started\" announcement plays"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7a082d553766",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4498c7182a6f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Audio is discarded after transcription. Only the transcript and your notes persist"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d7b3b4bc5591",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e9b2fcb543d9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You should still let participants know you're using Granola. Granola can send an automated consent message at the start of each meeting."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "50c85f70eaab",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e5d21c82ee85",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "2c2c09320ca0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "47b9f800b0ab"
          ],
          "text": "transcription documentation"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f4246664a1ea",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " confirms this architecture. You need this approach most in the meetings where taking notes is hardest: VC pitch calls, M&A exploratory discussions, executive recruiting conversations, and board sessions where a visible participant changes the dynamic immediately."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "47b9f800b0ab",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://docs.granola.ai/help-center/taking-notes/transcription"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6ae7f7d3ca74",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "794cfcab6e73",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Institutional memory that survives turnover"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "dd26fdda70f2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d79082aa088b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Shared team folders (available on both Basic and Business plans) keep your founding team's meeting history searchable even when people leave. A new hire can query \"Why did we deprioritize the enterprise tier in Q2?\" or \"What did customers say about pricing in discovery calls?\" and get citations from actual product and sales conversations rather than reconstructed summaries. This addresses one of the most concrete risks at the seed-to-Series A stage: critical context locked in the heads of two or three early employees."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c81764dedcf7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "41d36cf04f50",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Try Granola free:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "cc0b07ff358b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Download for "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f3a6893d441a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "342ea8df3ca2"
          ],
          "text": "Mac, Windows, or iOS"
        },
        {
          "_key": "da521019e46b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", connect your calendar, and run your next meeting. If you qualify for the startup program, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "d7d7f3072ca7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "9e96fea9dc4f"
          ],
          "text": "apply for 1 year free"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c4a7d1557445",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
